{"id": 267, "date": "2026-10-01T15:41:58", "date_gmt": "2026-10-01T15:41:58", "guid": {"rendered": "https://medluxlife.de/health/clinical-treatments/iv-treatments/", "raw": "https://medluxlife.de/health/clinical-treatments/iv-treatments/"}, "modified": "2026-10-18T11:00:59", "modified_gmt": "2026-10-18T11:00:59", "password": "", "slug": "iv-treatments", "status": "publish", "type": "page", "link": "https://medluxlife.de/health/clinical-treatments/iv-treatments/", "title": {"raw": "IV Treatments", "rendered": "IV Treatments"}, "content": {"raw": "<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"medlux-intro\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center medlux-intro\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-lead\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-lead\">IV treatments deliver vitamins, minerals and other nutrients directly into the bloodstream, so they are fully available to the body. They are designed to support energy, regeneration and overall well-being, and every infusion is selected after a short medical assessment.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1460,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-intro-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-intro-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/entspannte-infusion-im-wellness-lounge-ambiente-opt.jpg\" alt=\"Woman relaxing in a lounge chair during an IV treatment\" class=\"wp-image-1460\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Our IV treatments</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-treatment-grid\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"20rem\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-treatment-grid\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1461,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/regenbogen-infusion-mit-fruchten-und-krautern-opt.jpg\" alt=\"Colourful IV bag with fresh fruit, symbolising vitamins\" class=\"wp-image-1461\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Myers' Cocktail</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A classic infusion with vitamin C, B vitamins, magnesium and calcium to support energy, immunity and general well-being.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":2458,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/iv-lounge-relaxing-armchair.jpg\" alt=\"Woman relaxing in an armchair in a bright IV lounge\" class=\"wp-image-2458\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">NAD+</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Nicotinamide adenine dinucleotide is a coenzyme involved in cellular energy production. The infusion is used to support energy, mental clarity and healthy ageing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1463,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/gemini-generated-image-wrnjckwrnjckwrnj-opt.jpg\" alt=\"Woman with long, healthy-looking hair\" class=\"wp-image-1463\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hair and Nail Cocktail</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Supports stronger hair and nails and healthy hair growth, and nourishes the follicles, for example after a hair transplant.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":888,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-photo-340.jpg\" alt=\"Woman relaxing in a robe during treatment\" class=\"wp-image-888\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Beauty Cocktail</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Supports skin firmness, smoothness and moisture, promotes collagen production and complements facial mesotherapy.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":889,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-photo-341.jpg\" alt=\"Slim waist, weight management theme\" class=\"wp-image-889\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Fat Burning Slim Boost</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>With L-carnitine and other nutrients to support metabolism and fat burning as part of a weight-management programme.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":890,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-photo-342.jpg\" alt=\"IV drip with fresh oranges\" class=\"wp-image-890\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Vitamin C Megadose</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>High-dose vitamin C with antioxidant properties that supports the immune system, tissue regeneration and collagen production.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1464,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/erfrischende-wellness-auszeit-mit-zitronenwasser-opt.jpg\" alt=\"Smiling woman with a glass of lemon water in a bright lounge\" class=\"wp-image-1464\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Alpha Lipoic Acid</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A strong antioxidant that helps to regenerate other antioxidants such as vitamins C and E and supports nerve health and metabolism.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":892,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-photo-344.jpg\" alt=\"Hands forming a heart on the stomach\" class=\"wp-image-892\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Immune Plus</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Supports immune function, energy metabolism and antioxidant capacity.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1428,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-photo-345-opt.jpg\" alt=\"Smiling woman holding a green smoothie\" class=\"wp-image-1428\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Anti-ageing Collagen Booster</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Amino acids, vitamins and minerals that support collagen production, skin health and overall vitality.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":980,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-photo-c267a.jpg\" alt=\"Fresh antioxidant-rich berries\" class=\"wp-image-980\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Glutathione</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A powerful antioxidant that supports the body's natural detoxification and the immune system and helps protect cells from oxidative stress.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How MedLuxLife supports you</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-steps\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"20rem\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-steps\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Free consultation</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Contact us and tell us what you are interested in. We advise you and refer you to the right specialist in T\u00fcrkiye for an online consultation. Medical documents go directly to the doctor, only on request.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Personal treatment plan</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our partner specialists prepare a treatment plan and an estimated timeline tailored to you.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Travel &amp; treatment</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We coordinate your appointments, hotel and airport transfers, so you can focus on your treatment.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Aftercare</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We stay in touch after you return home and help with follow-up questions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-cta\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-cta\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Plan your IV treatment with confidence</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Every treatment begins with a personal, no-obligation consultation. Contact us and we will get back to you as soon as possible.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"medlux-btn-primary\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-primary\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://medluxlife.de/contact/\">Request a Free Consultation</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button -->\n\n<!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"medlux-btn-whatsapp\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-whatsapp\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://wa.me/380979092326\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WhatsApp</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-disclaimer\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-disclaimer\">The information on this page is for general guidance only and does not replace a medical consultation. Suitability for any treatment is assessed individually by a qualified doctor.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->", "rendered": "\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center medlux-intro is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-e35d3e13 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"medlux-lead wp-block-paragraph\">IV treatments deliver vitamins, minerals and other nutrients directly into the bloodstream, so they are fully available to the body. They are designed to support energy, regeneration and overall well-being, and every infusion is selected after a short medical assessment.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-intro-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1531\" height=\"1027\" src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/entspannte-infusion-im-wellness-lounge-ambiente-opt.jpg\" alt=\"Woman relaxing in a lounge chair during an IV treatment\" class=\"wp-image-1460\" srcset=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/entspannte-infusion-im-wellness-lounge-ambiente-opt.jpg 1531w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/entspannte-infusion-im-wellness-lounge-ambiente-opt-300x201.jpg 300w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/entspannte-infusion-im-wellness-lounge-ambiente-opt-1024x687.jpg 1024w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/entspannte-infusion-im-wellness-lounge-ambiente-opt-768x515.jpg 768w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/entspannte-infusion-im-wellness-lounge-ambiente-opt-18x12.jpg 18w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1531px) 100vw, 1531px\" /></figure>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Our IV treatments</h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-treatment-grid is-layout-grid wp-container-core-group-is-layout-5e4b10ce wp-block-group-is-layout-grid\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/regenbogen-infusion-mit-fruchten-und-krautern-opt.jpg\" alt=\"Colourful IV bag with fresh fruit, symbolising vitamins\" class=\"wp-image-1461\" srcset=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/regenbogen-infusion-mit-fruchten-und-krautern-opt.jpg 1536w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/regenbogen-infusion-mit-fruchten-und-krautern-opt-300x200.jpg 300w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/regenbogen-infusion-mit-fruchten-und-krautern-opt-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/regenbogen-infusion-mit-fruchten-und-krautern-opt-768x512.jpg 768w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/regenbogen-infusion-mit-fruchten-und-krautern-opt-18x12.jpg 18w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1536px) 100vw, 1536px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Myers&#8217; Cocktail</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A classic infusion with vitamin C, B vitamins, magnesium and calcium to support energy, immunity and general well-being.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/iv-lounge-relaxing-armchair.jpg\" alt=\"Woman relaxing in an armchair in a bright IV lounge\" class=\"wp-image-2458\" srcset=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/iv-lounge-relaxing-armchair.jpg 1536w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/iv-lounge-relaxing-armchair-300x200.jpg 300w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/iv-lounge-relaxing-armchair-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/iv-lounge-relaxing-armchair-768x512.jpg 768w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/iv-lounge-relaxing-armchair-18x12.jpg 18w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1536px) 100vw, 1536px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">NAD+</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Nicotinamide adenine dinucleotide is a coenzyme involved in cellular energy production. The infusion is used to support energy, mental clarity and healthy ageing.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\" src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/gemini-generated-image-wrnjckwrnjckwrnj-opt.jpg\" alt=\"Woman with long, healthy-looking hair\" class=\"wp-image-1463\" srcset=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/gemini-generated-image-wrnjckwrnjckwrnj-opt.jpg 1600w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/gemini-generated-image-wrnjckwrnjckwrnj-opt-300x200.jpg 300w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/gemini-generated-image-wrnjckwrnjckwrnj-opt-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/gemini-generated-image-wrnjckwrnjckwrnj-opt-768x512.jpg 768w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/gemini-generated-image-wrnjckwrnjckwrnj-opt-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/gemini-generated-image-wrnjckwrnjckwrnj-opt-18x12.jpg 18w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1600px) 100vw, 1600px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hair and Nail Cocktail</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Supports stronger hair and nails and healthy hair growth, and nourishes the follicles, for example after a hair transplant.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"905\" src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-photo-340.jpg\" alt=\"Woman relaxing in a robe during treatment\" class=\"wp-image-888\" srcset=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-photo-340.jpg 1280w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-photo-340-300x212.jpg 300w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-photo-340-1024x724.jpg 1024w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-photo-340-768x543.jpg 768w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-photo-340-18x12.jpg 18w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Beauty Cocktail</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Supports skin firmness, smoothness and moisture, promotes collagen production and complements facial mesotherapy.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"759\" src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-photo-341.jpg\" alt=\"Slim waist, weight management theme\" class=\"wp-image-889\" srcset=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-photo-341.jpg 1280w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-photo-341-300x178.jpg 300w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-photo-341-1024x607.jpg 1024w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-photo-341-768x455.jpg 768w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-photo-341-18x12.jpg 18w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Fat Burning Slim Boost</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">With L-carnitine and other nutrients to support metabolism and fat burning as part of a weight-management programme.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"854\" src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-photo-342.jpg\" alt=\"IV drip with fresh oranges\" class=\"wp-image-890\" srcset=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-photo-342.jpg 1280w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-photo-342-300x200.jpg 300w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-photo-342-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-photo-342-768x512.jpg 768w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-photo-342-18x12.jpg 18w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Vitamin C Megadose</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">High-dose vitamin C with antioxidant properties that supports the immune system, tissue regeneration and collagen production.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/erfrischende-wellness-auszeit-mit-zitronenwasser-opt.jpg\" alt=\"Smiling woman with a glass of lemon water in a bright lounge\" class=\"wp-image-1464\" srcset=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/erfrischende-wellness-auszeit-mit-zitronenwasser-opt.jpg 1536w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/erfrischende-wellness-auszeit-mit-zitronenwasser-opt-300x200.jpg 300w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/erfrischende-wellness-auszeit-mit-zitronenwasser-opt-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/erfrischende-wellness-auszeit-mit-zitronenwasser-opt-768x512.jpg 768w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/erfrischende-wellness-auszeit-mit-zitronenwasser-opt-18x12.jpg 18w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1536px) 100vw, 1536px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Alpha Lipoic Acid</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A strong antioxidant that helps to regenerate other antioxidants such as vitamins C and E and supports nerve health and metabolism.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" deco